category: Audio
requires: libheadsetcontrol1 libhidapi-devel
sdesc: "Tool to control certain aspects of USB-connected headsets (development)"
ldesc: "A tool to control certain aspects of USB-connected headsets on Linux.
Currently, support is provided for adjusting sidetone, getting battery state,
controlling LEDs, and setting the inactive time. See below for which headset
supports which feature."
external-source: HeadsetControl

